    {
      "id": "ec27fa9b",
      "kind": "text",
      "numbered": true,
      "no_override": "",
      "bullet": "",
      "title_ja": "取引後の遵守事項",
      "title_en": "Conditions of release after it has dealings",
      "underline": true,
      "page_break_before": false,
      "note": "",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "indent": 1,
          "marker": "(1)",
          "ja": "品質保証/Quality assurance",
          "en": ""
        },
        {
          "indent": 1,
          "marker": "①",
          "ja": "無償保証期間(以下、保証期間とする。)は、当工場納入後 1 年間とする。",
          "en": "A free guaranteed term (Hereafter, make it to the guaranteed term) is assumed to be one year after this factory is delivered."
        },
        {
          "indent": 1,
          "marker": "②",
          "ja": "保証期間において、製造者の責任に起因する故障が発生した場合は、無償にて修理・交換を行うものとする。",
          "en": "Repair and exchange it free of charge when the breakdown that originates in manufacturer's responsibility occurs at the guaranteed term."
        },
        {
          "indent": 1,
          "marker": "③",
          "ja": "保証期間後に発生した故障に対する修理・交換は有償とする。",
          "en": "The repair and the exchange for the breakdown that occurred after the guaranteed term are assumed for a fee."
        },
        {
          "indent": 2,
          "marker": "",
          "ja": "ただし、設計又は製造の不適切に基づく欠陥については、製造者と当工場が協議し原因を明らかにした後、製造者に原因がある場合は保障期間後といえど無償修理・交換するものとする",
          "en": "However, free repair and exchange the defect based on the inadequacy of the design or manufacturing after the guaranteed term when the manufacturer has the cause ,after the manufacturer's conferring with this factory and clarifying the cause."
        },
        {
          "indent": 1,
          "marker": "(2)",
          "ja": "保守/ Maintenance",
          "en": ""
        },
        {
          "indent": 2,
          "marker": "",
          "ja": "保守は原則として当社(保守会社を含む)で行う。",
          "en": "As a rule, our company (The maintenance company is included) maintains it."
        },
        {
          "indent": 1,
          "marker": "(3)",
          "ja": "仕様変更/Specification change",
          "en": ""
        },
        {
          "indent": 2,
          "marker": "",
          "ja": "製造者は、本仕様書の内容及び本仕様書の規定無き事項でも、性能・外観・保守等に影響を及ぼす部分を変更する場合は、事前に当工場に通知し承認を得るものとする。",
          "en": "The manufacturer must notify this factory beforehand and obtain approval , When the part that influences the performance, externals, and maintenance, etc. is changed, even the matter in which the content of this specifications and this specifications are not provided"
        },
        {
          "indent": 2,
          "marker": "",
          "ja": "なおこの通知は、当工場における充分な評価期間 6 ヶ月以上を見込むものとする。",
          "en": "As for this notification, expect enough evaluation period in this factory six months or more."
        },
        {
          "indent": 1,
          "marker": "(4)",
          "ja": "販売業務/Sales task",
          "en": ""
        },
        {
          "indent": 2,
          "marker": "",
          "ja": "製造者は、当工場から購入中止の通知がある迄、本仕様書対象品の納入を継続するものとする。",
          "en": "The manufacturer must continue the delivery of this specifications object goods from this factory to the notification of the purchase discontinuance."
        },
        {
          "indent": 2,
          "marker": "",
          "ja": "ただし、部品入手不可・物量減等やむを得ない事情にて納入できない事態が考えられる場合は、事前に当工場に通知するものとする。",
          "en": "However, notify this factory beforehand, when the situation that cannot be delivered by unavoidable circumstances such as cannot obtain parts and the physical superiority decreases is thought."
        },
        {
          "indent": 2,
          "marker": "",
          "ja": "なおこの通知は，当工場における充分な検討期間 3 ヶ月以上を見込んで行い対応については両者が協議のうえ決定するものとする。",
          "en": "Decide this notification of the doing correspondence expecting enough examination period in this factory three months or more after both confer."
        },
        {
          "indent": 2,
          "marker": "",
          "ja": "また、製造者は対応が決定する迄は本仕様書対象品の納入を継続するものとする。",
          "en": "Moreover, the manufacturer must continue the delivery of this specifications object goods until correspondence is decided."
        },
        {
          "indent": 1,
          "marker": "(5)",
          "ja": "廃形後の部品供給・修理実施/ Part presentation and repair execution after type of abolition",
          "en": ""
        },
        {
          "indent": 2,
          "marker": "",
          "ja": "製造者は、本仕様書対象品の当工場から購入中止通知後 15 年間の保守部品の納入及び本仕様書対象品の最終納入後 15 年間の修理対応を実施するものとする。",
          "en": "The manufacturer must execute the repair correspondence for 15 years the delivery of service parts of 15 years and after this specifications object goods are finally delivered after the purchase discontinuance is notified from this factory of this specifications object goods."
        },
        {
          "indent": 2,
          "marker": "",
          "ja": "ただし、その時点で製造者入手不可能なものについては両者協議のうえ代替え品をもって代えることができる。",
          "en": "However, the one that the manufacturer cannot be obtained at that time can be substituted with the replacement after it confers on both."
        }
      ],
